# Setlist Archive URLs (/archive)

All URL slugs for **Setlist Archive** pages must start with `/archive`.

## Convention

- **Base path**: `/archive`
- **Examples**:
  - Years: `/archive/years?id={uuid}` — use `getYearArchiveUrl(yearId)` from `lib/year-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/years/{uuid}` **301** to the query form via `public/_redirects`.
  - Tours: `/archive/tours?id={uuid}` — use `getTourArchiveUrl(tourId)` from `lib/tour-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/tours/{uuid}` **301** to the query form via `public/_redirects`.
  - Songs index: `/archive/songs`. **Song detail**: `/archive/song?id={uuid}` — use `getSongArchiveUrl(songId)` from `lib/song-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/song/{uuid}` **301** to the query form via `public/_redirects`.
  - Stats: `/archive/stats`, **Personnel index**: `/archive/personnel`. **Personnel detail**: `/archive/personnel?id={uuid}` — use `getPersonnelArchiveUrl(guestId)` from `lib/personnel-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/personnel/{uuid}` **301** via `public/_redirects`.
  - **Venues index**: `/archive/venues`. **Venue detail**: `/archive/venue?id={venue_id or venue name}` — use `getVenueArchiveUrl(venueKey)` from `lib/venue-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/venue/{segment}` **301** via `public/_redirects`.
  - **Discography index**: `/archive/discography`. **Discography release**: `/archive/discography?id={uuid}` — use `getDiscographyArchiveUrl(releaseUuid)` from `lib/discography-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/discography/{uuid}` **301** via `public/_redirects`.
  - **Lists index**: `/archive/lists`. **List detail**: `/archive/lists?id={uuid}` — use `getListArchiveUrl(listId)` from `lib/list-archive-url.ts`. **Legacy** `/archive/lists/{uuid}` **301** via `public/_redirects`.
  - **Setlist Game index**: `/archive/setlistgame`. **Per-show game**: `/archive/setlistgame?id={show_id}` — `getSetlistGameShowArchiveUrl` from `lib/setlist-game-archive-url.ts`. **Per-tour game**: `/archive/setlistgame?tour_id={tour_id}` — `getSetlistGameTourArchiveUrl`. **Legacy** `/archive/setlistgame/{uuid}` and `/archive/setlistgame/tour/{uuid}` **301** via `public/_redirects`.
  - **Public user stats**: `/archive/user?tab={slug}&id={user_uuid}` — use `getUserProfileUrl` from `lib/user-profile-url.ts` (overview tab). **Legacy** `/archive/user/{tab}?id=…` **301** via `public/_redirects`.
  - Submit: `/archive/submit`
  - **Show setlist (per-show)**: `/archive/setlist?id={uuid}` — use `getSetlistArchiveUrl(showId)` from `lib/setlist-archive-url.ts` for every internal link. Static export cannot add new `generateStaticParams` entries after deploy; query-based URLs avoid that. **Legacy** `/archive/setlist/{uuid}` URLs **301** to `/archive/setlist?id=…` via `public/_redirects` on Netlify. **Legacy** `?show_id=` is still accepted on the client and replaced with `?id=` for the same value.

## Implementation

- **App Router**: Place Setlist Archive pages under `app/(main)/archive/...` (e.g. `app/(main)/archive/years/page.tsx`, …, `app/(main)/archive/setlistgame/page.tsx`, `app/(main)/archive/user/page.tsx`).
- **Links**: Use `/archive/...` and the `get*ArchiveUrl` helpers above for internal links (show setlist, year, tour on archive, song, personnel, list, venue, discography, setlist game show/tour). For public user profile links, use `getUserProfileUrl`.
- **Breadcrumbs**: For any Setlist Archive page, the first breadcrumb segment after Home must show **"Setlist Archive"** (not "Dpro"); link target remains `/archive`.
- **Pathname checks**: Treat `pathname.startsWith("/archive")` as “user is in Setlist Archive” for sidebar expansion and active state.

## Checklist when adding or changing Setlist Archive routes

- [ ] Route path starts with `/archive`
- [ ] Sidebar nav uses `/archive/...` for the corresponding item
- [ ] Any internal links to setlist pages use `/archive/...`
